WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.186
Police militarization.

00:00:02.136 --> 00:00:04.772
When policing becomes occupation.

00:00:04.772 --> 00:00:15.034
Canadian police forces have acquired military-grade equipment, expanded tactical capabilities, and adopted crowd-control doctrines that blur the line between policing and military operations.

00:00:15.034 --> 00:00:23.715
The 2010 G20 summit in Toronto saw the largest mass detention in Canadian history — over one thousand arrests, most without charges.

00:00:23.715 --> 00:00:31.522
The 2022 Freedom Convoy response deployed armoured vehicles, tactical teams, and the Emergencies Act against peaceful protesters.

00:00:31.522 --> 00:00:41.818
RCMP enforcement actions against Indigenous land defenders at Wet'suwet'en and Fairy Creek deployed military-style operations against Canadian citizens on their own territory.

00:00:41.818 --> 00:00:51.499
Each deployment represents a documented escalation in the use of state force against civilian populations — not in response to armed threats, but in response to political dissent.

00:00:51.499 --> 00:00:58.159
Three documented deployments where Canadian policing operated as a military-style force against civilian populations.

00:00:58.159 --> 00:01:00.261
Equipment escalation.

00:01:00.261 --> 00:01:05.215
The documented acquisition of military-grade equipment by Canadian police forces.

00:01:05.215 --> 00:01:07.136
The coercion layer.

00:01:07.136 --> 00:01:12.590
Police militarization is the visible coercion layer of the institutional capture architecture.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:17.727
When the national security state conducts surveillance, police forces conduct enforcement.

00:01:17.727 --> 00:01:21.874
When the Emergencies Act freezes accounts, police clear the streets.

00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:28.988
When industry needs pipelines built through Indigenous territory, RCMP tactical teams enforce the court injunctions.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:35.511
The military has been degraded — as documented in the military purge analysis — but the police have been militarized.

00:01:35.511 --> 00:01:46.818
The result: a domestic enforcement capability that operates against citizens rather than foreign threats, equipped with military hardware but accountable through civilian mechanisms designed for a different era of policing.

00:01:46.818 --> 00:01:54.284
The coercion layer ensures that when captured institutions make decisions, those decisions are enforced regardless of democratic consent.
